      "seed": 1388220415,
      "version": 255,
      "versionNonce": 1500906417,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1746693784493,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. avg row size -> 200B \n - 1 req -> 1 row -> 200B\n- peak -> 40K * 200B\n- 5 year -> 5 * 400 * 10^5 * 40K * 200B ->  160 * 10^14 B 160 * 10^5 GB -> 16000 TB\n\n- 2 digit tb of data in single node. \n-> instance -> total no of nodes * price ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. avg row size -> 200B \n - 1 req -> 1 row -> 200B\n- peak -> 40K * 200B\n- 5 year -> 5 * 400 * 10^5 * 40K * 200B ->  160 * 10^14 B 160 * 10^5 GB -> 16000 TB\n\n- 2 digit tb of data in single node. \n-> instance -> total no of nodes * price ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
